WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.457 --> 00:00:04.519
- I'm really sorry, guys.

00:00:04.519 --> 00:00:05.814
We really screwed up.

00:00:05.814 --> 00:00:09.277
A lot of you may have noticed
in some of the videos recently

00:00:09.277 --> 00:00:12.458
how crappy the audio quality is.

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:16.299
That's because my camera
guy messed up on the audio.

00:00:16.299 --> 00:00:18.422
I've been using the same
camera guy for a long time

00:00:18.422 --> 00:00:21.954
and he's great and he really
cares deeply about the quality

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:24.307
of the videos and he takes
a lot of pride in his work,

00:00:24.307 --> 00:00:27.170
and we didn't notice the day of,

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.337
so I film once a month usually
the first or second Thursday,

00:00:33.061 --> 00:00:35.259
no, first or second
Wednesday of the month,

00:00:35.259 --> 00:00:38.500
and that, we just recorded
and he didn't notice

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.853
that the audio wasn't picking up properly

00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:43.090
and we just basically figured out

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:44.755
once we transferred all the files.

00:00:44.755 --> 00:00:48.145
And I know a lot of you
guys are complaining,

00:00:48.145 --> 00:00:50.050
a lot of you guys are
upset, and rightfully so.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:54.744
The audio sounds like junk and
it's not our usual standard

00:00:54.744 --> 00:00:58.645
and I appreciate the love,
I appreciate the support,

00:00:58.645 --> 00:01:02.707
I appreciate you trying to
hold me to higher standards.

00:01:02.707 --> 00:01:06.259
I sincerely do, so we
had options, you know.

00:01:06.259 --> 00:01:08.191
It was either we keep it up as it is,

00:01:08.191 --> 00:01:11.127
not film it again for our schedule

00:01:11.127 --> 00:01:14.794
until the beginning of
next month and we decided,

00:01:14.794 --> 00:01:17.253
you know what, the points are still good.

00:01:17.253 --> 00:01:18.961
The points are still good.

00:01:18.961 --> 00:01:20.444
I like the content.

00:01:20.444 --> 00:01:23.072
The audio sucks, but the
points are still good.

00:01:23.072 --> 00:01:24.677
I still want to give you guys value.

00:01:24.677 --> 00:01:26.903
It's not what you're used
to and again I'm sorry,

00:01:26.903 --> 00:01:30.177
but the content is still good,

00:01:30.177 --> 00:01:32.708
and I hope you will bear with me,

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:35.815
have some patience as these
videos keep coming out

00:01:35.815 --> 00:01:39.131
until probably the first week of August,

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:40.702
maybe the second week of August

00:01:40.702 --> 00:01:42.582
just depending on the production schedule.

00:01:42.582 --> 00:01:44.658
Yeah, and you know what, mess ups happen.

00:01:44.658 --> 00:01:47.086
We try to avoid them, we
try to eliminate them.

00:01:47.086 --> 00:01:49.719
I'm sure you guys messed up a
couple times in your business

00:01:49.719 --> 00:01:53.636
and you go through, you
battle on, you fix them

00:01:55.077 --> 00:01:58.224
for the next time and hope
that they don't happen again,

00:01:58.224 --> 00:02:00.029
and I'd love to hear what mess up

00:02:00.029 --> 00:02:02.116
you had recently in your business.

00:02:02.116 --> 00:02:03.846
Leave that down in the comments below.

00:02:03.846 --> 00:02:07.287
Make me feel good for our team messing up

00:02:07.287 --> 00:02:08.456
and disappointing you guys.

00:02:08.456 --> 00:02:10.251
I think most of all, it's
just a disappointment.

00:02:10.251 --> 00:02:12.400
You know, we try to make content

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.327
that is high quality
that I'm really proud of.

00:02:15.327 --> 00:02:17.439
There's a lot of work
that my entire team puts

00:02:17.439 --> 00:02:20.121
into creating the videos
that we make every week

00:02:20.121 --> 00:02:22.685
for you guys to help you stay motivated

00:02:22.685 --> 00:02:25.258
and get ideas and it's
really a lot of love.

00:02:25.258 --> 00:02:27.549
Everybody, I promise you,
everybody on the team

00:02:27.549 --> 00:02:30.316
puts a ton of love into making sure

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.050
that it's a good quality product

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:35.074
as best as we know how to
make and sometimes we mess up

00:02:35.074 --> 00:02:38.063
and this was a pretty big
mess up, and I'm really,

00:02:38.063 --> 00:02:40.946
I'm really sorry to do that to you guys.

00:02:40.946 --> 00:02:43.764
I'm way harder on myself, trust me,

00:02:43.764 --> 00:02:45.689
than the comments that you
guys had for me coming in.

00:02:45.689 --> 00:02:47.527
And thank you too for the support.

00:02:47.527 --> 00:02:49.547
There's been some really
supportive comments,

00:02:49.547 --> 00:02:51.318
so thank you for the love.

00:02:51.318 --> 00:02:53.388
I really appreciate it, and again,

00:02:53.388 --> 00:02:54.949
hopefully you can bear with us

00:02:54.949 --> 00:02:57.427
until we get to the next
group of recordings,

00:02:57.427 --> 00:03:00.156
but in the meantime
that you need to enjoy,

00:03:00.156 --> 00:03:03.753
use it as an opportunity to remember

00:03:03.753 --> 00:03:06.883
the good quality content and be grateful

00:03:06.883 --> 00:03:11.050
for what is coming ahead, awesome
stuff next time I promise.

00:03:12.146 --> 00:03:14.546
Thank you guys again for
the support and I'm sorry.

00:03:14.546 --> 00:03:16.699
Hope you have a great weekend.

00:03:16.699 --> 00:03:19.835
Continue to believe in
whatever your one word is.

00:03:19.835 --> 00:03:21.276
Much love, guys.

00:03:21.276 --> 00:03:22.776
I'll see you soon.

